==Battleground==
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss after 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
*5 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Rain D.]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*2 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Battle Items#Sniper the Cat|Sniper the Cat]] is a tremendous help here, being able to stall the early Celeboodle to get [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] on the field. The inherent difficulty comes from the early rush of enemy spam, but once that's cleared THE SLOTH is an easy cleanup. The most efficient method for dealing with the enemies here is to group them up and have Bahamut Cat nuke them, while meatshielding to protect him.

